//   tests/imported/fail/nll/issue-95272.logos
//   tests/imported/fail/regions/regions-bounded-method-type-parameters-trait-bound.logos
// Both were re-ported against their own upstream files (the invariant carrier
// restored), both are refused by the committed compiler, and both are refused by
// rustc 1.98.1. They no longer move under the arm. Do NOT spend another round on
// them, and do not trust a handed-down list of blockers — including this one —
// without re-measuring it.
//
// THE ARM STILL DOES NOT LAND, AND THE REASON IS NOW A DIFFERENT, SINGLE FIXTURE
// FOUND BY L4 AND NOT BY fail_text_oracle:
//   tests/spec/fail/region_diag_1__callee-bound-at-call   base rc 1 -> armed rc 0
// fail_text_oracle selects `-L bc -L fail` (1881 tests). The corpus holds 3086
// fail-mode tests, 494 of them in the spec tier, and a spec fixture carries
// NEITHER label — so that oracle's "CHANGED 0" is true and blind here. Measured
